### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client).
### Start the FastAPI backend first (task "Serve: FastAPI backend" or F5 -> "Serve: FastAPI backend (uvicorn)"),
### then click "Send Request" above any block below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Ask a question (hybrid mode)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Who led the resistance at Jhansi?",
  "mode": "hybrid",
  "k": 5
}

### Ask a question (vector-only, for comparison)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Who led the resistance at Jhansi?",
  "mode": "vector",
  "k": 5
}

### Ask a question (graph-only, for comparison)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Who led the resistance at Jhansi?",
  "mode": "graph",
  "k": 5
}
